                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli iwe Babiloni tamwakatale amumfwika nakabili ukulila kwa maseese, ukwimba kwa ŋomba, ukulila kwa bamutolilo na mapenga. Kabili muli iwe tamwakatale amusangwa fundi wa mulimo uuli onse, ne congo ca libwe ililepela tacakatale acumfwikamo nakalya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
