            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulubuuto lwa cisaniko talwakatale alumoneka muli iwe nakabili. Ishiwi lyakwa shibwinga na nabwinga talyakatale alyumfwika nakabili muli iwe. Abamakwebo bobe ebalumbwike nganshi mu calo conse. Amalele yobe yabepaike imishobo yonse.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
